{"id":"8dd5a913cb2152a3","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations.md","title":"Turing-Machine Configuration","display":"df-turing-machine-configuration — Turing-Machine Configuration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations","aliases":["73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations","73-df-turing-machine-configuration"],"display":"df-turing-machine-configuration — Turing-Machine Configuration","depends_on":["[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations</span><span>73-df-turing-machine-configuration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-machine-configuration — Turing-Machine Configuration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a63442026b2f1a9a\" href=\"?note=a63442026b2f1a9a\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm\">73-df-eight-tuple-dtm</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (single-tape DTM, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a63442026b2f1a9a\" href=\"?note=a63442026b2f1a9a\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm\">73-df-eight-tuple-dtm</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\">\\(T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\)</span> (candidate tape)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{supp}_{\\mathrm{blank}}(T)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\neq\\mathrm{blank}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{supp}_{\\mathrm{blank}}(T)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\neq\\mathrm{blank}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\coloneqq\n\\{(q,T,h):q\\in Q\\land T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\land\n|\\operatorname{supp}_{\\mathrm{blank}}(T)|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\coloneqq\n\\{(q,T,h):q\\in Q\\land T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\land\n|\\operatorname{supp}_{\\mathrm{blank}}(T)|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Only finitely many tape cells are nonblank in a finite configuration; the head position is an integer because the tape is two-way infinite.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","status":"resolved","id":"a63442026b2f1a9a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","status":"resolved","id":"a63442026b2f1a9a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}$ (single-tape DTM, see [[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{supp}_{\\mathrm{blank}}(T)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\neq\\mathrm{blank}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\coloneqq\n\\{(q,T,h):q\\in Q\\land T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\land\n|\\operatorname{supp}_{\\mathrm{blank}}(T)|<\\aleph_0\\land h\\in\\mathbb Z\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1204,"backlinks":[{"id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"51696a3513b66fda","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Conf}_M$ (configuration set, see [[73-df-dtm-finite-support-configurations]])"}],"outgoing":["a63442026b2f1a9a"]}